@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Staff" as User
participant "StaffPage" as UI
participant "FieldOperationController" as Controller
participant "FieldOperationService" as Service
participant "SlotRepository / BookingRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-16: Manage Unavailable Slots ==

User -> UI : 1. Block or unblock a field time
activate User
activate UI

UI -> UI : 2. blockSlot() / unblockSlot(slotId)
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> UI : 3. Validate form/filter state
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> Controller : 4. POST /api/slots/block\nPUT /api/slots/{slotId}/unblock
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. blockSlot(request) / unblockSlot(slotId)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. requireOperator; valid range; no active booking
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. findByField...; existsBySlotAndStatusIn; save
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE slot; check booking
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. Blocked or available Slot
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Store reason/creator or clear block metadata
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Booked slot or invalid state -> HTTP 400
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> UI : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI : 15. reloadCalendar()
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI --> User : 16. Refresh operational calendar

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
